      <h2>2. Indicative freight rates from China to France</h2>
      <p>
        Le Havre has published benchmark depth in the Europe dataset: the WorldFreightHub Europe route
        data carries <strong>$1,200–$4,800 for a 20ft</strong>, <strong>$1,600–$6,800 for a
        40ft</strong> and <strong>$60–$150 per CBM for LCL</strong>, all MEDIUM confidence. Rail is
        described in relative terms — roughly two to three times sea per container — but has no published
        dollar figure, and air, express and DDP were not published in the snapshot, so those stay LOW with
        a request-for-quote marker.
      </p>

      <DataTable
